346	     * (starting 1 July) that contains it, zero-padded (e.g. a date of 2026-09-05 falls in fiscal year
347	     * 2027 -> {@code "27"}). This is the bare numeric segment behind the {@code "FY"}-prefixed
348	     * {@link #getFiscalYear()} and is also the segment the controller stamps into an owner's
349	     * identifier; the fiscal-year rule itself lives in {@link #fiscalYear(LocalDate)} and is shared,
350	     * not duplicated.
